 clients and teams can review design work at true scale instead of on a flat screen.\n\nOpen any project and find everything where you left it: the activity feed, discussions, blockers, the schedule, files and folders. Step into 360 panoramas and renderings, place 3D models and room scans from the IDColab app in your space, page through drawings and PDFs, and play project videos on a large screen.\n\nReview together. Leave comments and pins on images, panoramas, PDFs and 3D models, mention a teammate, star what matters and mark decisions. Everything you add appears on idcolab.com and in the IDColab mobile app right away, and their changes appear here.\n\nBuilt for the headset: a project rail you can reach, panels that stay in your space, and full support for hand tracking and controllers. Sign in without typing: open idcolab.com/link on your phone or computer and enter the code the headset shows.\n\nYou need an IDColab account. Create one for free at idcolab.com.", "short_description": "Walk through your design projects at true scale with your whole team. IDColab on Quest opens the same projects, files, 3D models, panoramas and drawings as idcolab.com and the IDColab mobile app, with comments, pins and decisions that stay in sync everywhere. Sign in with a code from your phone or computer."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.idcolab.com/PrivacyPolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.idcolab.com/TermsofService", "publisher_name": "Idcolab INC", "support_website_url": "https://www.idcolab.com/contactUs", "website_url": "https://www.idcolab.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT